{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1388422762"}, "name":{"label":"IMPOSTALOVA#1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-31T09:16:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13577698867"}, "title":{"label":"Remote play option suggestion"}, "content":{"label":"This game is amazing! Me and my family love it so so much but my 2 older sibling are about to fly home to there different homes. We all enjoyed this game so much playing together and were wondering if there is any way Imposters could come out with a remote option where you log into a group, and then everyone gets their hint in their own phone - so that it can be played on call from different locations. It could also include a text feature for people to share their clues digitally. This feature would allow so many families to stay in contact and continue to have a ton of fun just like when they are together. Thank you for (hopefully) looking at this review and it would be amazing to see future updates of this amazing game!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6745120053&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
